  $x$q-icecore-035$x$, $x$pte-2026-01$x$, $x$PTE$x$, $x${"PTE","IELTS"}$x$::text[], 'reading', $x$reading-mcq-single$x$, $x$Multiple Choice, Single Answer$x$, $x$Reading the Ice$x$, $x$Why is very old ice difficult to find?$x$, $x$[{"id": "It survives undisturbed only in a few places near the bedrock", "text": "It survives undisturbed only in a few places near the bedrock"}, {"id": "It contains no trapped air bubbles", "text": "It contains no trapped air bubbles"}, {"id": "It is always destroyed by volcanic activity", "text": "It is always destroyed by volcanic activity"}, {"id": "It lies beneath areas that cannot be reached by aircraft", "text": "It lies beneath areas that cannot be reached by aircraft"}]$x$::jsonb, $x$["It survives undisturbed only in a few places near the bedrock"]$x$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $x$Paragraph I: finding a patch where ancient ice survives undisturbed near the bedrock.$x$, $x$hard$x$, 10, 0, TRUE, $x$rp-icecore-01$x$, $x$g-icecore-7$x$, 4);

